---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import TypedLede from '../components/TypedLede.astro';
import SkillsMarquee from '../components/SkillsMarquee.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About — Data Bee"
  description="A one-line summary of who you are and what you do."
  canonicalPath="/about/"
>
  <main class="content-shell" data-pagefind-body>
    <div class="section" style="max-width: var(--max);">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-me">
          <div class="about-card">
            <h3>About</h3>
            <div class="about-prose">
              <div class="about-intro">
                <img src="/assets/profile.jpeg" width="80" height="80" alt="Profile Picture">
                <div class="about-intro-content">
                  <p><b>Welcome to this site!</b> You can contact me through following channels.</p>
                  <div class="nav-tools">
                <a class="nav-icon-link" href="https://github.com/your-username" aria-label="GitHub" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82A7.64 7.64 0 0 1 8 3.87c.68 0 1.36.09 2 .26 1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.01 8.01 0 0 0 16 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8Z" />
                  </svg>
                </a>
                <a class="nav-icon-link" href="https://linkedin.com/in/your-profile" aria-label="LinkedIn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 0 1-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 1 1 2.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/>
                  </svg>
                </a>
                <a class="nav-icon-link" href="mailto:i@aretexoxo.com" aria-label="Email">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2" />
                    <path d="m2 7 10 7 10-7" />
                  </svg>
                </a>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p><i>I am a new developer.</i> I started the journery through developing on low-code platforms. I make dashboards, and not so often apps. With the rise of AI, now I am able to code, which's amazing!</p>

              <p>I've been in the Microsoft ecosystem for serveral years, so I am expanding my expertise on Azure and trying other tech stacks at the same time. With tons of tools, my philsophy of AI-coding is: think and elevate before sending prompts. I would like to build on others's code, and make contributions.</p>

              <p><i>I am an English learner.</i> So I am writing in English to improve my skills. A kind request would be to let me know it if the sentences are incorrect to you. </p>

              <p>In my leisure time, I enjoy singing, listening to music and doing some yoga. My favorite spots are museum, cinema, theatre and bookstore. You know me I like coffee. I also like to explore the world.</p>
              
              <p>
                ✔︎Singapore<br/>
                ✔︎Portugal<br/>
                Waiting to add more...
              </p>

              <p>📢 Knowing people is a pleasure. Feel free to contact!</p>

            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside>
          <div class="sidebar-card">
            <h3>Badge Wall</h3>
            <div class="badge-entry">
              <p class="badge-name"><a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/credentials/certifications/developing-ai-enabled-database-solutions/?practice-assessment-type=certification" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--accent);">SQL AI Developer Associate</a></p>
              <p class="badge-issuer"><span style="color: var(--ink)">Microsoft</span> · 2026</p>
            </div>
            <div class="badge-entry">
              <p class="badge-name"><a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/credentials/certifications/azure-data-fundamentals/?practice-assessment-type=certification" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--accent);">Azure Data Fundamentals</a></p>
              <p class="badge-issuer"><span style="color: var(--ink)">Microsoft</span> · 2025</p>
            </div>
            <div class="badge-entry">
              <p class="badge-name"><a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/credentials/certifications/azure-fundamentals/?practice-assessment-type=certification" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--accent);">Azure Fundamentals</a></p>
              <p class="badge-issuer"><span style="color: var(--ink)">Microsoft</span> · 2024</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
